    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da98403693b60d4437aa379e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来吧国王，请下令！",
      "source_fingerprint": "feeb78fe0d64c2cc14ccd867748c32726f8cd3d62c07fe2cc41cce77e2cf8fd8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c14b483854d7f5ff80e7ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就，请你下次为我做些甜点",
      "source_fingerprint": "c919036acdff129a4595a60e8a43be6832666f7fc2dada2e0794a2387095ff2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:002be5d70134ef76fd0e8675",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，一起去看喜剧吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d500c968404deabc6a466a4631f60cc6f9144413102f31353426dfcf302edd43",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
