    {
      "uid": "zhcn:814b56d325eb9b95134c91a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甜点……好的，我很乐意。\n我会准备些方便食用，\n适合陪您查资料时享用的点心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97a4c58738e0a95c37019f0218cc741b13218b0d845ca89fb61a52edea547ce8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
