    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c38a4754ff142915c171f60e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为参考，可以告诉我\n训练员喜欢什么口味吗？\n我想送您爱吃的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61fc99d6f85136c99a710ae960c5a55a6713f6f32e1b13ac145428565138714d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c19456b579a799ceaaf055f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对西沙里奥的询问，我告诉了她自己的甜点喜好。\n她似乎已经有了大致构想，\n让我期待几天后的成品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6fbd181ce28b15e3e2cbb838cb03a825b129d95586ffa86cc1515da6bb85a83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
