    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3014f6e9a91795ad1b2053",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是蚕豆大小的小摆件，\n造型有蛋糕和可爱动物，还有月亮与王子等\n各种各样的类型……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15896b5acbe0cd9fda0600d8ff124dff1a7f7a24f33fc907b4276ae7e07b4f11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
