    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55015ce2bfdb45dfe75cf141",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个……这枚费弗，\n真的可以送给我吗？\n明明是训练员抽中的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e9f64017f9dd6b19535a73192f4b8977fe8d187396a2d33e78d5dd94eb8efeb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
