    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b39ab16ca6f98d95c768417",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，好可爱的小熊♪\n接下来一段时间书桌中央的位置就是你的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c6a2189f9035557d49ffb973d798d86b498f32a6853b778ad2ddd57e7a6b1fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3af96c63d4e3eb90d0893fc5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你为什么会开始收集费弗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "398d557971ec61c3a67e42f92b67e1deeea0bcd87e5fc5c88bd37149e38da858",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd49370f94634b24950fac1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你为什么开始收集费弗呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a6935fc0829abc7712ee41c3e94e7faa63d8f7f6d6c2fdf2e177bc7ccaedb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e3e99ee818adc2936532883",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着她用指尖轻抚小熊脑袋的样子，\n我由衷觉得送给她真是太好了。\n不过，她似乎真的非常喜欢费弗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea5ac9f7214bd1a7925b448025a7c5f77084776f26858b3aba68fa867b6888f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61ea09d93b8a9cddb72d887b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6dbbf428d59cde36cd239f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也没有什么特别的理由。\n只是在一家小杂货店看到它时，\n无论如何都想要便央求父母买给我――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b738fe90c0849d9fca4ba18ab4ccb85febbf733234ea61e18db4089c6d8c8a76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de7ac145245e01281a7e699e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110706.json",
      "json_path": [
