    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ecddc01e3b61d2a59d868ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我，从小就有收集费弗这个小爱好。\n也会把它们摆在房间的书桌上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e74a48d3b078e7b0be55cdd70901cdcbc3d3e1a8d6af7b8ca605d84161baa20b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
