    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feface5e3698e4caa0ace626",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回过神时数量已经相当可观了。\n最近我很喜欢把它们排列成\n自己中意的喜剧场景。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66088de94dfd95862132a8ed6081ee24a58d725ae1e86305fd61ea51ee3f9510",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
