    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d59a237e1b0f9761a75e4461",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵呵，您能理解吗？就是这样。\n前些天我又不知不觉沉迷其中……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c140d940f51057cd704082317ec01124fbc9d6bc80060b51ff49e72f9c996d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
