      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥露出了灿烂的笑容。\n既然她这么喜欢，或许可以买一个\n放在训练员室里装饰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6175dc664bb71b88b9d92f0877f88a80501681a3306182ebed0bf9bc3bc52d59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
